(7107780, 1084003, 96751, '<td valign="top">I really love this image. A fabulous portrait with what looks like a lensbaby or pinhole. Not sure the overlay is needed. All this being said, except for it being a portrait, this is radically different from the original, which uses lighting for its impact.</td>', 'I really love this image. A fabulous portrait with what looks like a lensbaby or pinhole. Not sure the overlay is needed. All this being said, except for it being a portrait, this is radically different from the original, which uses lighting for its impact.', '2013-09-27 16:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7107781, 1083748, 96751, '<td valign="top">Disturbing yet compelling. I feel there are too many technical issues with this image to make it great, even though it does elicit strong emotions. On the other hand, the lack of technicals gives it a "verite" feel, so...  Just wish the blood wasn''t pink.</td>', 'Disturbing yet compelling. I feel there are too many technical issues with this image to make it great, even though it does elicit strong emotions. On the other hand, the lack of technicals gives it a "verite" feel, so...  Just wish the blood wasn''t pink.', '2013-09-27 16:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7107782, 1084083, 112828, '<td valign="top">Excellent.</td>', 'Excellent.', '2013-09-27 16:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
