(7109754, 1084063, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>The B&amp;W tones are very good and the zoom is nicely done. It took me awhile to figure out how the picture relates to the title. I am sure quite a few viewers don''t spend a ton of time pondering which I feel is why so it is up to the photographer to provide more clues within the shot to tell/support the ''story''. I like the use of zoom to create the lines of movement in the shot. I now get it that the man is leaving in a hurry - in ''protest''. But I am left wondering - in protest of what? Is this a restaurant that he is upset with the service? Is this a theatre or sports venue where he is leaving in disgust/protesting the performance? I don''t know because there are a lack of visual clues in the shot that it cannot complete the story. Lastly, I feel that had you captured more of man''s face showing expression it could greatly help with the story you are trying to project. If we can clearly see he has an angry face or one of disgust, we know that his emotion is driving him to protest by walking out.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. The B&W tones are very good and the zoom is nicely done. It took me awhile to figure out how the picture relates to the title. I am sure quite a few viewers don''t spend a ton of time pondering which I feel is why so it is up to the photographer to provide more clues within the shot to tell/support the ''story''. I like the use of zoom to create the lines of movement in the shot. I now get it that the man is leaving in a hurry - in ''protest''. But I am left wondering - in protest of what? Is this a restaurant that he is upset with the service? Is this a theatre or sports venue where he is leaving in disgust/protesting the performance? I don''t know because there are a lack of visual clues in the shot that it cannot complete the story. Lastly, I feel that had you captured more of man''s face showing expression it could greatly help with the story you are trying to project. If we can clearly see he has an angry face or one of disgust, we know that his emotion is driving him to protest by walking out.', '2013-10-02 10:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7109775, 1084070, 5364, '<td valign="top">I''m voting without comparing to the original<br/> <br/>I like this a lot. The geometric patterns appeal to me, but then so does the emotion - struggling to break in (or out).</td>', 'I''m voting without comparing to the original I like this a lot. The geometric patterns appeal to me, but then so does the emotion - struggling to break in (or out).', '2013-10-02 11:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
